{"id":"forecast-05","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-05/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":1011.32,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.5,"text":"4. You will hear a lecturer talking on the topic of sustainability. First you have some","words":[["4.",0.0,0.82],["You",2.02,2.24],["will",2.24,2.4],["hear",2.4,2.64],["a",2.64,2.86],["lecturer",2.86,3.2],["talking",3.2,3.72],["on",3.72,4.02],["the",4.02,4.1],["topic",4.1,4.46],["of",4.46,4.74],["sustainability.",4.74,5.26],["First",6.32,7.0],["you",7.0,7.22],["have",7.22,7.34],["some",7.34,7.5]]},{"start":7.5,"end":65.32,"text":"time to look at questions 31-40 on page 7. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31-40.","words":[["time",7.5,7.84],["to",7.84,8.04],["look",8.04,8.16],["at",8.16,8.28],["questions",8.28,8.56],["31",8.56,9.28],["-40",9.28,9.86],["on",9.86,10.48],["page",10.48,10.74],["7.",10.74,11.14],["Now",61.82,62.1],["listen",62.1,62.44],["carefully",62.44,62.92],["and",62.92,63.22],["answer",63.22,63.62],["questions",63.62,63.96],["31",63.96,64.76],["-40.",64.76,65.32]]},{"start":68.67,"end":74.51,"text":"This week's lecture on a scientific topic of current general interest is on sustainability.","words":[["This",68.67,69.13],["week's",69.13,69.49],["lecture",69.49,69.79],["on",69.79,70.31],["a",70.31,70.43],["scientific",70.43,70.89],["topic",70.89,71.43],["of",71.43,71.67],["current",71.67,72.03],["general",72.03,72.47],["interest",72.47,73.13],["is",73.13,73.81],["on",73.81,73.97],["sustainability.",73.97,74.51]]},{"start":74.51,"end":82.07,"text":"sustainability. The term sustainability is not new. It was first coined in 1987 in a report","words":[["sustainability.",74.51,74.81],["The",75.29,75.99],["term",75.99,76.43],["sustainability",76.43,77.11],["is",77.11,77.59],["not",77.59,77.85],["new.",77.85,78.23],["It",78.63,78.73],["was",78.73,78.91],["first",78.91,79.15],["coined",79.15,79.51],["in",79.51,79.77],["1987",79.77,80.69],["in",80.69,81.63],["a",81.63,81.75],["report",81.75,82.07]]},{"start":82.07,"end":88.25,"text":"for the United Nations World Commission on Environment and Development. Since then, however,","words":[["for",82.07,82.29],["the",82.29,82.39],["United",82.39,82.61],["Nations",82.61,83.15],["World",83.15,83.63],["Commission",83.63,84.07],["on",84.07,84.57],["Environment",84.57,85.11],["and",85.11,85.73],["Development.",85.73,86.17],["Since",87.07,87.49],["then,",87.49,87.79],["however,",88.03,88.25]]},{"start":88.71,"end":93.85,"text":"the term has been applied to everything from cars to agriculture and even economics.","words":[["the",88.71,88.83],["term",88.83,89.13],["has",89.13,89.33],["been",89.33,89.51],["applied",89.51,89.85],["to",89.85,90.09],["everything",90.09,90.45],["from",90.45,90.77],["cars",90.77,91.33],["to",91.33,91.61],["agriculture",91.61,92.25],["and",92.25,93.11],["even",93.11,93.31],["economics.",93.31,93.85]]},{"start":95.05,"end":100.99,"text":"My specific focus, in fact, derives from this problem. I want to analyze what seems to","words":[["My",95.05,95.41],["specific",95.41,95.91],["focus,",95.91,96.47],["in",96.57,96.69],["fact,",96.69,96.99],["derives",97.33,97.81],["from",97.81,98.09],["this",98.09,98.27],["problem.",98.27,98.65],["I",99.03,99.25],["want",99.25,99.39],["to",99.39,99.55],["analyze",99.55,99.99],["what",99.99,100.27],["seems",100.27,100.63],["to",100.63,100.99]]},{"start":100.99,"end":104.29,"text":"need to be the confusion that surrounds sustainability.","words":[["need",100.99,101.27],["to",101.27,101.51],["be",101.51,101.65],["the",101.65,101.77],["confusion",101.77,102.39],["that",102.39,103.19],["surrounds",103.19,103.75],["sustainability.",103.75,104.29]]},{"start":105.97,"end":113.11,"text":"That UN document defines sustainable development as development that allows both the present","words":[["That",105.97,106.73],["UN",106.73,107.07],["document",107.07,107.59],["defines",107.59,108.31],["sustainable",108.31,109.17],["development",109.17,109.83],["as",109.83,110.43],["development",110.43,111.07],["that",111.07,111.51],["allows",111.51,112.01],["both",112.01,112.37],["the",112.37,112.67],["present",112.67,113.11]]},{"start":113.11,"end":116.29,"text":"and all future generations to meet their needs.","words":[["and",113.11,113.55],["all",113.55,113.87],["future",113.87,114.31],["generations",114.31,115.05],["to",115.05,115.41],["meet",115.41,115.59],["their",115.59,115.85],["needs.",115.85,116.29]]},{"start":117.33,"end":118.47,"text":"Here is the first myth.","words":[["Here",117.33,117.61],["is",117.61,117.79],["the",117.79,117.93],["first",117.93,118.13],["myth.",118.13,118.47]]},{"start":119.39,"end":125.01,"text":"Sustainability is not simply about the environment, which may come as a surprise to you.","words":[["Sustainability",119.39,120.11],["is",120.11,120.57],["not",120.57,120.85],["simply",120.85,121.37],["about",121.37,121.75],["the",121.75,122.03],["environment,",122.03,122.57],["which",122.95,123.47],["may",123.47,123.65],["come",123.65,123.91],["as",123.91,124.11],["a",124.11,124.25],["surprise",124.25,124.53],["to",124.53,124.85],["you.",124.85,125.01]]},{"start":125.01,"end":130.23,"text":"In fact, the original definition says nothing about it at all.","words":[["In",125.01,125.15],["fact,",125.15,125.47],["the",126.01,126.27],["original",126.27,126.69],["definition",126.69,127.29],["says",127.29,128.27],["nothing",128.27,128.91],["about",128.91,129.37],["it",129.37,129.61],["at",129.61,129.91],["all.",129.91,130.23]]},{"start":131.97,"end":134.93,"text":"Sustainability is not about protecting the world around us.","words":[["Sustainability",131.97,132.65],["is",132.65,132.85],["not",132.85,133.07],["about",133.07,133.35],["protecting",133.35,133.85],["the",133.85,134.07],["world",134.07,134.33],["around",134.33,134.67],["us.",134.67,134.93]]},{"start":135.59,"end":141.25,"text":"The original focus was on finding ways to help poor nations catch up with richer nations,","words":[["The",135.59,135.83],["original",135.83,136.13],["focus",136.13,136.55],["was",136.55,136.83],["on",136.83,137.07],["finding",137.07,137.49],["ways",137.49,137.91],["to",137.91,138.27],["help",138.27,138.49],["poor",138.49,138.89],["nations",138.89,139.37],["catch",139.37,140.03],["up",140.03,140.29],["with",140.29,140.47],["richer",140.47,140.79],["nations,",140.79,141.25]]},{"start":141.61,"end":147.43,"text":"which primarily meant giving them similar rights to natural resources, water, food,","words":[["which",141.61,141.81],["primarily",141.81,142.29],["meant",142.29,142.79],["giving",142.79,143.17],["them",143.17,143.47],["similar",143.47,143.87],["rights",143.87,144.43],["to",144.43,144.71],["natural",144.71,145.15],["resources,",145.15,145.89],["water,",146.41,146.77],["food,",147.17,147.43]]},{"start":147.83,"end":151.45,"text":"energy, the things that many of us take for granted.","words":[["energy,",147.83,148.15],["the",148.99,149.25],["things",149.25,149.63],["that",149.63,149.89],["many",149.89,150.21],["of",150.21,150.41],["us",150.41,150.59],["take",150.59,150.93],["for",150.93,151.15],["granted.",151.15,151.45]]},{"start":151.45,"end":156.99,"text":"The consequence and ultimate goal was improving living standards for all.","words":[["The",151.45,152.37],["consequence",152.37,152.89],["and",152.89,153.39],["ultimate",153.39,153.83],["goal",153.83,154.29],["was",154.29,154.69],["improving",154.69,155.25],["living",155.25,155.59],["standards",155.59,156.17],["for",156.17,156.65],["all.",156.65,156.99]]},{"start":157.77,"end":165.75,"text":"Another myth is that sustainability is a synonym for green, as in green movement, green products,","words":[["Another",157.77,158.49],["myth",158.49,158.89],["is",158.89,159.49],["that",159.49,159.69],["sustainability",159.69,160.23],["is",160.23,160.99],["a",160.99,161.13],["synonym",161.13,161.61],["for",161.61,162.09],["green,",162.09,162.55],["as",163.13,163.39],["in",163.39,163.59],["green",163.59,164.19],["movement,",164.19,164.71],["green",164.93,165.21],["products,",165.21,165.75]]},{"start":165.95,"end":166.17,"text":"etc.","words":[["etc.",165.95,166.17]]},{"start":167.09,"end":169.37,"text":"Although there is some overlap between the terms.","words":[["Although",167.09,167.27],["there",167.27,167.49],["is",167.49,167.65],["some",167.65,167.97],["overlap",167.97,168.45],["between",168.45,168.83],["the",168.83,169.03],["terms.",169.03,169.37]]},{"start":170.15,"end":176.05,"text":"Green suggests a preference for natural living, for example, when you go shopping.","words":[["Green",170.15,170.61],["suggests",170.61,171.41],["a",171.41,171.97],["preference",171.97,172.33],["for",172.33,172.83],["natural",172.83,173.29],["living,",173.29,173.81],["for",173.95,174.09],["example,",174.09,174.53],["when",174.97,175.19],["you",175.19,175.39],["go",175.39,175.57],["shopping.",175.57,176.05]]},{"start":176.05,"end":183.53,"text":"Nothing—products marketed as green—imply the absence of high technology and mass manufacturing","words":[["Nothing—products",176.05,177.27],["marketed",177.27,177.63],["as",177.63,178.01],["green—imply",178.01,179.25],["the",179.25,179.53],["absence",179.53,180.11],["of",180.11,180.43],["high",180.43,180.73],["technology",180.73,181.49],["and",181.49,181.95],["mass",181.95,182.81],["manufacturing",182.81,183.53]]},{"start":183.53,"end":184.19,"text":"processes.","words":[["processes.",183.53,184.19]]},{"start":185.03,"end":193.71,"text":"Those groups who campaign for sustainability—we can call them the lobby for sustainability—acknowledge","words":[["Those",185.03,185.75],["groups",185.75,186.17],["who",186.17,186.47],["campaign",186.47,187.15],["for",187.15,187.59],["sustainability—we",187.59,189.51],["can",189.51,189.77],["call",189.77,190.07],["them",190.07,190.33],["the",190.33,190.81],["lobby",190.81,191.19],["for",191.19,191.59],["sustainability—acknowledge",191.59,193.71]]},{"start":193.71,"end":195.79,"text":"that the situation is desperate.","words":[["that",193.71,194.17],["the",194.17,194.31],["situation",194.31,194.81],["is",194.81,195.31],["desperate.",195.31,195.79]]},{"start":196.57,"end":204.11,"text":"The main problem they state correctly is time, with six billion people on the planet now,","words":[["The",196.57,197.03],["main",197.03,197.35],["problem",197.35,197.93],["they",197.93,198.31],["state",198.31,198.77],["correctly",198.77,199.37],["is",199.37,200.31],["time,",200.31,200.81],["with",201.03,201.87],["six",201.87,202.17],["billion",202.17,202.51],["people",202.51,202.95],["on",202.95,203.21],["the",203.21,203.35],["planet",203.35,203.65],["now,",203.65,204.11]]},{"start":204.11,"end":208.19,"text":"and a billion more expected in the next 30 years.","words":[["and",204.11,204.89],["a",204.89,205.23],["billion",205.23,205.69],["more",205.69,206.15],["expected",206.15,206.67],["in",206.67,207.03],["the",207.03,207.13],["next",207.13,207.37],["30",207.37,207.69],["years.",207.69,208.19]]},{"start":209.01,"end":214.85,"text":"Only technology will be able to provide everyone with an acceptable and safe lifestyle.","words":[["Only",209.01,209.49],["technology",209.49,210.25],["will",210.25,210.71],["be",210.71,210.91],["able",210.91,211.13],["to",211.13,211.33],["provide",211.33,211.65],["everyone",211.65,212.25],["with",212.25,212.61],["an",212.61,212.75],["acceptable",212.75,213.23],["and",213.23,213.87],["safe",213.87,214.27],["lifestyle.",214.27,214.85]]},{"start":215.67,"end":221.63,"text":"Electric cars, wind turbines, and solar cells are key examples of this.","words":[["Electric",215.67,216.17],["cars,",216.17,216.71],["wind",217.29,217.67],["turbines,",217.67,218.15],["and",218.51,218.67],["solar",218.67,219.09],["cells",219.09,219.67],["are",219.67,220.41],["key",220.41,220.63],["examples",220.63,221.11],["of",221.11,221.41],["this.",221.41,221.63]]},{"start":222.35,"end":227.69,"text":"They make great use of renewable resources while emitting fewer noxious chemicals.","words":[["They",222.35,222.61],["make",222.61,222.79],["great",222.79,223.07],["use",223.07,223.37],["of",223.37,223.69],["renewable",223.69,224.17],["resources",224.17,224.91],["while",224.91,225.51],["emitting",225.51,226.11],["fewer",226.11,226.63],["noxious",226.63,227.25],["chemicals.",227.25,227.69]]},{"start":227.69,"end":235.73,"text":"Nuclear power, too, is something the sustainability lobby has come to accept, unlike most Greens.","words":[["Nuclear",227.69,229.21],["power,",229.21,229.59],["too,",229.61,229.93],["is",230.21,230.39],["something",230.39,230.73],["the",230.73,231.01],["sustainability",231.01,231.49],["lobby",231.49,232.13],["has",232.13,232.73],["come",232.73,232.99],["to",232.99,233.25],["accept,",233.25,233.73],["unlike",234.39,234.93],["most",234.93,235.35],["Greens.",235.35,235.73]]},{"start":241.35,"end":242.73,"text":"And here's the third myth.","words":[["And",241.35,241.51],["here's",241.51,241.79],["the",241.79,241.93],["third",241.93,242.39],["myth.",242.39,242.73]]},{"start":243.57,"end":246.43,"text":"It concerns the role of technology.","words":[["It",243.57,243.67],["concerns",243.67,244.23],["the",244.23,245.05],["role",245.05,245.43],["of",245.43,245.75],["technology.",245.75,246.43]]},{"start":247.13,"end":253.99,"text":"Technology is not rejected as evil, but we should not overemphasize the role of technology","words":[["Technology",247.13,247.69],["is",247.69,248.25],["not",248.25,248.49],["rejected",248.49,249.19],["as",249.19,249.71],["evil,",249.71,250.17],["but",250.65,250.93],["we",250.93,251.15],["should",251.15,251.33],["not",251.33,251.63],["overemphasize",251.63,252.83],["the",252.83,253.01],["role",253.01,253.23],["of",253.23,253.41],["technology",253.41,253.99]]},{"start":253.99,"end":254.25,"text":"either.","words":[["either.",253.99,254.25]]},{"start":254.81,"end":257.05,"text":"Take electric cars, for example.","words":[["Take",254.81,255.13],["electric",255.13,255.75],["cars,",255.75,256.29],["for",256.57,256.67],["example.",256.67,257.05]]},{"start":257.05,"end":262.87,"text":"example. Researchers are currently working on plans to electrify the world's car fleet.","words":[["example.",257.05,257.21],["Researchers",257.85,258.31],["are",258.31,258.85],["currently",258.85,259.29],["working",259.29,259.59],["on",259.59,259.93],["plans",259.93,260.43],["to",260.43,260.81],["electrify",260.81,261.51],["the",261.51,261.73],["world's",261.73,262.33],["car",262.33,262.57],["fleet.",262.57,262.87]]},{"start":263.73,"end":269.55,"text":"New technology is currently being developed to make better batteries, giving longer performance.","words":[["New",263.73,264.05],["technology",264.05,264.65],["is",264.65,265.19],["currently",265.19,265.65],["being",265.65,266.05],["developed",266.05,266.49],["to",266.49,266.71],["make",266.71,266.91],["better",266.91,267.35],["batteries,",267.35,267.95],["giving",268.11,268.35],["longer",268.35,268.87],["performance.",268.87,269.55]]},{"start":270.45,"end":275.61,"text":"But a better way of thinking is perhaps to have battery stations for drivers to use","words":[["But",270.45,270.71],["a",270.71,270.85],["better",270.85,271.01],["way",271.01,271.31],["of",271.31,271.49],["thinking",271.49,271.81],["is",271.81,272.15],["perhaps",272.15,272.53],["to",272.53,272.83],["have",272.83,273.13],["battery",273.13,273.75],["stations",273.75,274.35],["for",274.35,274.63],["drivers",274.63,275.09],["to",275.09,275.37],["use",275.37,275.61]]},{"start":275.61,"end":281.59,"text":"on roads. When the battery is getting low, they simply swap the old one for a fully","words":[["on",275.61,275.89],["roads.",275.89,276.27],["When",277.01,277.23],["the",277.23,277.35],["battery",277.35,277.67],["is",277.67,277.89],["getting",277.89,278.11],["low,",278.11,278.51],["they",278.71,278.89],["simply",278.89,279.35],["swap",279.35,279.75],["the",279.75,280.09],["old",280.09,280.35],["one",280.35,280.63],["for",280.63,281.19],["a",281.19,281.33],["fully",281.33,281.59]]},{"start":281.59,"end":288.51,"text":"charged one. In other words, new business thinking, not new technology, for a sustainable","words":[["charged",281.59,282.03],["one.",282.03,282.31],["In",282.97,283.07],["other",283.07,283.23],["words,",283.23,283.59],["new",284.11,284.41],["business",284.41,284.93],["thinking,",284.93,285.39],["not",285.65,285.87],["new",285.87,286.41],["technology,",286.41,287.23],["for",287.77,287.97],["a",287.97,288.13],["sustainable",288.13,288.51]]},{"start":288.51,"end":293.29,"text":"future. There are similarities in agriculture where","words":[["future.",288.51,288.99],["There",290.13,290.77],["are",290.77,291.03],["similarities",291.03,291.75],["in",291.75,292.05],["agriculture",292.05,292.65],["where",292.65,293.29]]},{"start":293.29,"end":299.17,"text":"knowledge can be more productive than new technology. Agriculture uses up about three","words":[["knowledge",293.29,293.83],["can",293.83,294.19],["be",294.19,294.39],["more",294.39,294.63],["productive",294.63,295.19],["than",295.19,295.63],["new",295.63,295.87],["technology.",295.87,296.49],["Agriculture",297.03,297.53],["uses",297.53,298.19],["up",298.19,298.47],["about",298.47,298.79],["three",298.79,299.17]]},{"start":299.17,"end":304.91,"text":"quarters of the world's water. Some crops are very thirsty and require a lot of water.","words":[["quarters",299.17,299.53],["of",299.53,299.87],["the",299.87,299.99],["world's",299.99,300.41],["water.",300.41,300.63],["Some",301.41,301.73],["crops",301.73,302.07],["are",302.07,302.37],["very",302.37,302.59],["thirsty",302.59,302.91],["and",302.91,303.33],["require",303.33,303.87],["a",303.87,304.33],["lot",304.33,304.49],["of",304.49,304.65],["water.",304.65,304.91]]},{"start":305.59,"end":311.37,"text":"So many farmers who believe in sustainability are now planting crops like sunflowers and","words":[["So",305.59,305.79],["many",305.79,306.01],["farmers",306.01,306.39],["who",306.39,306.69],["believe",306.69,307.07],["in",307.07,307.25],["sustainability",307.25,307.93],["are",307.93,308.77],["now",308.77,308.97],["planting",308.97,309.35],["crops",309.35,309.77],["like",309.77,310.21],["sunflowers",310.21,311.11],["and",311.11,311.37]]},{"start":311.37,"end":315.59,"text":"wheat instead of corn, which are happy with much less water.","words":[["wheat",311.37,311.63],["instead",311.63,312.31],["of",312.31,312.49],["corn,",312.49,312.89],["which",313.41,313.67],["are",313.67,313.89],["happy",313.89,314.21],["with",314.21,314.49],["much",314.49,314.93],["less",314.93,315.19],["water.",315.19,315.59]]},{"start":316.87,"end":322.63,"text":"In terms of water consumption, one of the biggest problems is that our diet is changing.","words":[["In",316.87,317.49],["terms",317.49,317.73],["of",317.73,317.93],["water",317.93,318.17],["consumption,",318.17,318.75],["one",319.15,319.29],["of",319.29,319.43],["the",319.43,319.53],["biggest",319.53,319.85],["problems",319.85,320.47],["is",320.47,321.05],["that",321.05,321.25],["our",321.25,321.51],["diet",321.51,322.07],["is",322.07,322.29],["changing.",322.29,322.63]]},{"start":323.55,"end":329.23,"text":"As countries develop and people become richer, they aspire to a diet with more meat.","words":[["As",323.55,323.79],["countries",323.79,324.17],["develop",324.17,324.69],["and",324.69,325.09],["people",325.09,325.43],["become",325.43,325.77],["richer,",325.77,326.15],["they",326.93,327.13],["aspire",327.13,327.53],["to",327.53,327.95],["a",327.95,328.09],["diet",328.09,328.41],["with",328.41,328.65],["more",328.65,328.93],["meat.",328.93,329.23]]},{"start":330.15,"end":335.35,"text":"Now, admittedly, most of the new births that will take our population to over 6 billion","words":[["Now,",330.15,330.37],["admittedly,",330.53,331.11],["most",331.25,331.43],["of",331.43,331.67],["the",331.67,331.75],["new",331.75,331.91],["births",331.91,332.67],["that",332.67,332.87],["will",332.87,333.11],["take",333.11,333.31],["our",333.31,333.49],["population",333.49,334.13],["to",334.13,334.39],["over",334.39,334.59],["6",334.59,335.01],["billion",335.01,335.35]]},{"start":335.96,"end":340.05,"text":"are going to be born in countries with largely vegetarian diets.","words":[["are",335.96,336.27],["going",336.27,336.53],["to",336.53,336.71],["be",336.71,336.83],["born",336.83,337.13],["in",337.13,337.29],["countries",337.29,337.71],["with",337.71,338.11],["largely",338.11,338.71],["vegetarian",338.71,339.47],["diets.",339.47,340.05]]},{"start":340.05,"end":347.03,"text":"However, most of them will be born in the city, and this is where water consumption is highest.","words":[["However,",340.05,340.83],["most",341.59,341.93],["of",341.93,342.17],["them",342.17,342.37],["will",342.37,342.87],["be",342.87,343.01],["born",343.01,343.37],["in",343.37,343.65],["the",343.65,343.79],["city,",343.79,344.03],["and",344.61,344.93],["this",344.93,345.19],["is",345.19,345.37],["where",345.37,345.55],["water",345.55,345.97],["consumption",345.97,346.47],["is",346.47,346.73],["highest.",346.73,347.03]]},{"start":347.97,"end":351.49,"text":"That introduces the topic for next week's lecture.","words":[["That",347.97,348.65],["introduces",348.65,349.09],["the",349.09,349.51],["topic",349.51,349.87],["for",349.87,350.33],["next",350.33,350.69],["week's",350.69,351.25],["lecture.",351.25,351.49]]},{"start":356.18,"end":358.06,"text":"That is the end of section 4.","words":[["That",356.18,356.52],["is",356.52,356.64],["the",356.64,356.78],["end",356.78,357.14],["of",357.14,357.32],["section",357.32,357.54],["4.",357.54,358.06]]},{"start":358.78,"end":361.54,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",358.78,359.06],["now",359.06,359.32],["have",359.32,359.7],["half",359.7,360.04],["a",360.04,360.22],["minute",360.22,360.48],["to",360.48,360.72],["check",360.72,361.06],["your",361.06,361.22],["answers.",361.22,361.54]]},{"start":391.95,"end":394.07,"text":"That is the end of the listening test.","words":[["That",391.95,392.33],["is",392.33,392.49],["the",392.49,392.65],["end",392.65,39